{
  "bodyHash": "6783e240f4de7a60",
  "content": "\n\n<p>此模組新增了系列幾乎與《Minecraft Dungeons》（我的世界：地下城）中強大怪物和法師相同的技能與暗黑魔法。冰霜法師、地質法師、幽靈等眾多怪物的能力已被還原，並套用至《我的世界》中的任何敵對生物，使其遠比一般生物更為強大。</p>\n<p>這些技能會自然隨等級提升，最高達 5 級。在 1 級時，這些生物的能力平平無奇；但到了 5 級（預設上限，可設定至 10 級），它們將成為真正的強敵，實力堪稱首領級。</p>\n<p>雖然本模組可獨立運作，但 <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">強烈建議</span>搭配<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apex-contenders-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"> Apex Contenders: Elite \"infernal\" Mobs</span></strong></a> 模組使用，該模組為敵對生物添加了其他技能。然而，當與「地下城特徵生物」（DTM）結合時，會產生極具趣味且破壞力驚人的組合。DTM 作為 Elite \"Infernal\" Mobs 的擴充模組，會將其所有魔法特徵套用至該模組的<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>紫水晶</strong></span>特徵上。</p>\n<p>指令：</p>\n<p>DTM（地下城特徵生物）指令</p>\n<p>召喚隨機特徵：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;指令：/dtm summon &lt;實體&gt; &lt;位置&gt; &lt;等級&gt;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;範例：/dtm summon minecraft:zombie ~ ~ ~ 2</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>自訂召喚：</p>\n<p>召喚具有特定特徵的生物&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;指令：/dtm summon_custom &lt;實體&gt; &lt;位置&gt; &lt;等級&gt; &lt;特徵...&gt;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; 範例：/dtm summon_custom minecraft:skeleton ~ ~ ~ 3 geomancy sorcery</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>查看所有特徵請點這裡</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>特徵</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#3598db;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">氣之法師（風語者技能）</span></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstatic.wikia.nocookie.net%252fminecraft_gamepedia%252fimages%252fa%252fac%252fWind_Caller.png%252frevision%252flatest%253fcb%253d20210719121303\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/minecraft_gamepedia/images/a/ac/Wind_Caller.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210719121303\" alt=\"Wind Caller\" width=\"154\" height=\"181\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1594948/description_3a89aa3b-3c69-4ed5-a8d1-f2091e9beb56.gif\" width=\"581\" height=\"188\"></a></span></strong></p>\n<p>氣之法師生物會使用風語者攻擊，包含飛越敵人上方。</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#3598db;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">冰之法師（冰霜法師）</span></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstatic.wikia.nocookie.net%252fminecraft_gamepedia%252fimages%252f9%252f9b%252fIceologer.png%252frevision%252flatest%253fcb%253d20201009055818\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/minecraft_gamepedia/images/9/9b/Iceologer.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20201009055818\" alt=\"Iceologer\" width=\"152\" height=\"229\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1594948/description_88a8dfda-0d0a-42d3-aa65-e6feef1f147c.gif\" width=\"570\" height=\"185\"></a></span></strong></p>\n<p>冰之法師生物會在敵人上方召喚魔法寒冰碎塊進行攻擊。</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#236fa1;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">幽靈（亡靈法師）</span></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstatic.wikia.nocookie.net%252fminecraft_gamepedia%252fimages%252f7%252f7c%252fWraith.png%252frevision%252flatest%253fcb%253d20221107062218\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/minecraft_gamepedia/images/7/7c/Wraith.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20221107062218\" alt=\"Wraith\" width=\"150\" height=\"200\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1594948/description_527b39be-1cdc-4dc6-86ba-2ec11be860b0.gif\" width=\"584\" height=\"189\"></a></span></strong></p>\n<p>幽靈生物會使用靈魂之火燃燒其敵人。</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#b96ad9;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">巫術（法師）</span></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstatic.wikia.nocookie.net%252fminecraft_gamepedia%252fimages%252f2%252f20%252fMage.png%252frevision%252flatest%253fcb%253d20220815120618\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/minecraft_gamepedia/images/2/20/Mage.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20220815120618\" alt=\"Mage\" width=\"150\" height=\"167\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1594948/description_a9143edf-8b1a-4d82-85a8-280a1574a69a.gif\" width=\"583\" height=\"189\"></a></span></strong></p>\n<p>巫術生物會使用詭異的法術進行分身，並將你舉至空中，讓分身用飛彈攻擊你。</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#7e8c8d;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">地質法師（大地操控者）&nbsp;</span></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstatic.wikia.nocookie.net%252fminecraft_gamepedia%252fimages%252f6%252f61%252fGeomancer.png%252frevision%252flatest%253fcb%253d20220815113952\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/minecraft_gamepedia/images/6/61/Geomancer.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20220815113952\" alt=\"Geomancer\" width=\"148\" height=\"205\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1594948/description_5ebf38da-9ac1-4059-9a38-bda017645001.gif\" width=\"578\" height=\"187\"></a></span></strong></p>\n<p>地質法師生物能夠在您的位置召喚石柱，使戰場變得更加棘手。</p>",
